          -> {"results": [{"body": " am getting an error going to the site....What's up with that?\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Bud Stoll\\r\\nSent: Thursday, July 26, 2018 12:19 AM\\r\\nTo: allhands <allhands@froth.ly>\\r\\nSubject: Improved brewertalk.com - check it out!\\r\\n\\r\\nHey Frothlies!\\r\\n\\r\\nI just added some great improvements to brewertalk.com to better handle for=\\r\\num threads and allow for posts of multi-media kinds of files rather than ju=\\r\\nst photos. And it's all running in our new swanky AWS environment (\\\"the clo=\\r\\nud\\\" for those of you not sure what that is!) I think you'll be impressed en=\\r\\nough to maybe buy me a beer!  Let me know.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttp://www.brewertalk.com\\r\\n\\r\\n-BS\\r\\n\\r\\nBud Stoll\\r\\nHead IT Guy and AWS Wizard\\r\\nFrothly\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n--_000_CY4PR17MB1398D3F9C39427ABE137160FAF2B0CY4PR17MB1398namp_\\r\\n\",\"Content-Type: text/html; charset=\\\"us-ascii\\\"\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"<html xmlns:v=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\\\" xmlns:o=3D\\\"urn:schemas-micr=\\r\\nosoft-com:office:office\\\" xmlns:w=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\\\" =\\r\\nxmlns:m=3D\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml\\\" xmlns=3D\\\"http:=\\r\\n//www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40\\\">\\r\\n<head>\\r\\n<meta http-equiv=3D\\\"Content-Type\\\" content=3D\\\"text/html; charset=3Dus-ascii\\\"=\\r\\n>\\r\\n<meta name=3D\\\"Generator\\\" content=3D\\\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\\\">\\r\\n<style><!--\\r\\n/* Font Definitions */\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\\"Cambria Math\\\";\\r\\n\\tpanose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\\u2026[1000 more chars cut]", "count": "1"}, {"body": " don't mean to complain, but I am having a hard time registering on the si=\\r\\nte something about image verification....\\r\\n\\r\\n-F\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Peat Cerf\\r\\nSent: Thursday, July 26, 2018 12:26 AM\\r\\nTo: Bud Stoll <bstoll@froth.ly>; allhands <allhands@froth.ly>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Improved brewertalk.com - check it out!\\r\\n\\r\\nHow long do you want us to do this? I have you know... beer to make?\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Bud Stoll\\r\\nSent: Thursday, July 26, 2018 12:19 AM\\r\\nTo: allhands <allhands@froth.ly<mailto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: Improved brewertalk.com - check it out!\\r\\n\\r\\nHey Frothlies!\\r\\n\\r\\nI just added some great improvements to brewertalk.com to better handle for=\\r\\num threads and allow for posts of multi-media kinds of files rather than ju=\\r\\nst photos. And it's all running in our new swanky AWS environment (\\\"the clo=\\r\\nud\\\" for those of you not sure what that is!) I think you'll be impressed en=\\r\\nough to maybe buy me a beer!  Let me know.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttp://www.brewertalk.com\\r\\n\\r\\n-BS\\r\\n\\r\\nBud Stoll\\r\\nHead IT Guy and AWS Wizard\\r\\nFrothly\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n--_000_CY4PR17MB139844BF6949B097BA706ABCAF2B0CY4PR17MB1398namp_\\r\\n\",\"Content-Type: text/html; charset=\\\"us-ascii\\\"\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"<html xmlns:v=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\\\" xmlns:o=3D\\\"urn:schemas-micr=\\r\\nosoft-com:office:office\\\" xmlns:w=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\\\" =\\r\\nxmlns:m=3D\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml\\\" xmlns=3D\\\"http:=\\r\\\u2026[1000 more chars cut]", "count": "1"}, {"body": "an't wait bud\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Bud Stoll\\r\\nSent: Thursday, July 26, 2018 12:15 AM\\r\\nTo: Mallory Kraeusen <mkraeusen@froth.ly>\\r\\nSubject: I'm making some great changes to brewertalk!\\r\\n\\r\\nStay tuned.\\r\\n\\r\\n--_000_BLUPR17MB0449EEAE2FC6E147AE3FA66DDB2B0BLUPR17MB0449namp_\\r\\n\",\"Content-Type: text/html; charset=\\\"us-ascii\\\"\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"<html xmlns:v=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\\\" xmlns:o=3D\\\"urn:schemas-micr=\\r\\nosoft-com:office:office\\\" xmlns:w=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\\\" =\\r\\nxmlns:m